	(text "Power-up order (ADAR1000 Rev B p44-45 + ADTR1107 Rev C p24): +1V8_DIG/+3V3_AUX (always on) -> MCU -> +3V3_RF (VDD_SW, VDD_LNA, AVDD3) -> -5V_BF & -3V3_SW (PWR_EN_NEG) -> program PA_BIAS OFF = -1.75 V, CTRL_SW = RX -> +5V_PA rail -> PA_DRAIN_EN (hardware AND) -> raise VGG_PA for 220 mA."
	(at 297 20 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "a4d25965-739e-493b-a316-bc6559ab4f85")
)
	(text "Power-down: TX off (BF_TR low) -> PA_BIAS to -1.75 V -> PA_DRAIN_EN low -> negative rails -> +3V3_RF. A watchdog or NEG_OK fault removes the PA drain in hardware."
	(at 297 25 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "b494c6e3-0342-49f5-bdff-9d5357682fee")
)
	(text "All regulator blocks are UNRESOLVED placeholders (TBD_*), not parts: topology, inductors, compensation and feedback values are not designed yet."
	(at 297 30 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "12709262-16ae-40bf-81a0-1a5bce5d11a4")
)
	(text "H2-B PA drain switches U621-U624 (TI TPS22810 SLVSDH0C): QOD tied to VOUT (internal RPD 250-400 ohm at 5 V -> fast drain discharge on disable); CT = 2200 pF (TI test condition; tR ~0.5-0.7 ms); CIN = 1 uF per switch (TI recommended). EN/UVLO VENR 1.13-1.30 V < 1.8 V logic high."
	(at 297 45 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "f5937e01-09b5-48de-b888-30656ff9fd3c")
)
	(text "H2-C: U610 A0 -> SDA (A1 = GND) = 0x42 (INA226 SBOS547C Table 6-2), was GND = 0x40 duplicate of U611.\nC629 100 pF on PCA_VREF2/EN (PCA9306 SCPS113O 9.2.2.1)."
	(at 411.48 304.8 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "ef4401ef-90b9-448d-9485-04d4a99c4b99")
)
	(text "REC drain crowbar per chain c (H2C_SEQUENCING_SIM.md rev 2, items 1-4):\nQ96c CSD16301Q2 (SLPS235E): drain -> PWR_CB_Rc -> 3x 1R RCS1206 anti-surge in parallel (0.333 R; Vishay 20065) -> +5V_PA_Cc (U62c VOUT);\ngate PWR_CB_Gc pulled up 4.7k from +5V_PA_IN_Cc (U62c VIN side); Q97c DMG1012T (Vth 0.5-1.0 V, Rds 0.7R @ 1.8 V) holds gate low\nwhile PA_DRAIN_EN is high via 10k / 1nF C0G (PWR_CB_Dc). Break-before-make on fault, make-before-break on arm."
	(at 510.54 200.66 0)
	(effects
		(font
			(size 1.27 1.27)
		)
	)
	(uuid "c505482f-8499-4e07-bb6e-c17b1b765e52")
